1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:01,070
Hi.

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:08,730
Let's have a look at some useful phrases that can help you describe your job title.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,850
You can say I am a software developer.

4
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:16,700
I am a software engineer.

5
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,640
I am a QA engineer.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,370
I am a sales manager.

7
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:28,370
I am an HR or I work as a software developer.

8
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:30,140
I work as a QA.

9
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:38,990
I work as a project manager or my job title is a software engineer.

10
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:41,990
My job title is QA.

11
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:46,670
My job title is a project manager.

12
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:49,650
My job title is recruiter.

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:51,640
Thank you.

14
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:53,550
Please repeat the phrases.

15
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,500
And see you next time.

16
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,160
Bye.
